          "text": "Mgbe ahụ kwa, e meghere ụlọnsọ Chineke nke dị nʼeluigwe. A hụkwara igbe ọgbụgba ndụ nʼime ya. Nʼotu oge ahụ kwa, egbe eluigwe malitere ịgba, amụma gbukwara. Oke ifufe bidokwara ife. Oke ala ọma jijiji na akụmmiri igwe mere mkpọtụ nke ukwuu.",
